      "a4": "Yes! SmileCheck works on any device — computer, tablet or mobile.",
      "q5": "How does the level system work?",
      "a5": "There are 7 levels: Can, Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond and Adamantine. The more points you accumulate, the higher your level and the greater the benefits.",
